.DS_Store

# Benchmark scratch trees.
#
# Harnesses under tower/scripts/research/ take a --scratch root and write
# rebuilt worlds into it. Given a RELATIVE path they land wherever the
# process happened to start, which during the 2026-08-27 native-evaluation
# lane meant 133 MB of `sc/` and `sc2/` in the repo root -- untracked, easy
# to `git add -A` by accident, and indistinguishable at a glance from real
# data.
#
# Pass an absolute path outside the repo. These patterns are the backstop
# for when someone does not.
/sc/
/sc2/
/wb-scratch/

.Rhistory
__pycache__/
*.pyc
